{\b What this installs}\par
peerfectlyd.exe, the service that carries this machine's networks; peerfectly.exe, the command line and the tray; and wintun.dll, the WireGuard LLC driver for the network adapter, unmodified, under its own licence in wintun-LICENSE.txt beside it.\par
\par
{\b What uninstalling keeps}\par
The networks this machine holds, in %ProgramData%\\peerfectly, and their signing keys in the machine's key store. To remove a network and its keys, run {\f0 peerfectly forget <network>} before uninstalling.\par
